## Prerequisites

- uv
```
curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh
uv venv --python 3.12.0
uv pip install -r requirements.txt
```

- docker
- perf
- Flamegraph

## Getting started

### Install
- install_cubrid.sh
- install_pgvector.sh

### Test
- test.sh

- How to find dataset?

You can find dataset's name at the end of dataset.py
```
cat dataset.py
```

### Perf
- perf_watch_annb.sh
- perf_report.sh

### Deploy website
- serve_website.sh

### Misc
- docker_connect_cubrid.sh


## Trobuleshooting

- Disk usage
```
docker system prune
```
